#: ../../source/contents/commands/index.rst:2
msgid "Commands (MCDR Mode)"
msgstr "命令参考（MCDR 模式）"

#: ../../source/contents/commands/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"When running as an MCDReforged plugin, ResourcePackServer registers in-game "
"commands. The default command prefix is ``!!rps``."
msgstr "作为 MCDReforged 插件运行时，ResourcePackServer 会注册游戏内命令。默认命令前缀为 ``!!rps``。"

#: ../../source/contents/commands/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Command prefix and permission level can be changed in the config file. See :"
"doc:`/contents/config/index`."
msgstr "命令前缀和权限等级可在配置文件中修改。参见 :doc:`/contents/config/index`。"

